.el .ds Aq '
.TH quarters-clone 1  "quarters-clone " 
.SH NAME
quarters\-clone \- Clone persistent state into a new independent space
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquarters\-clone\fR [\fB\-\-preview\fR] [\fB\-\-confirm\-sensitive\-state\fR] [\fB\-\-include\-cache\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISOURCE\fR> <\fIDESTINATION\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Clone persistent state into a new independent space
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-preview\fR
Validate and summarize without creating the destination
.TP
\fB\-\-confirm\-sensitive\-state\fR \fI<SOURCE>\fR
Exactly repeat SOURCE to acknowledge copied state may contain credentials
.TP
\fB\-\-include\-cache\fR
Copy derived cache contents instead of recreating cache roots empty
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISOURCE\fR>
Existing source space
.TP
<\fIDESTINATION\fR>
New destination space
